flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/scans/start] --> B[Receive Project ID and Target ID]

    B --> C[Check User Permission]

    C --> D{User Owns Project?}

    D -- No --> E[Return 403 Forbidden]
    D -- Yes --> F[Check Target Scope]

    F --> G{Target In Scope?}

    G -- No --> H[Return Scan Blocked]
    G -- Yes --> I[Create Scan Job]

    I --> J[Select Scanner Tools]

    J --> K{Tool Selected}

    K -- Nmap --> L[Run Nmap Scan]
    K -- Nikto --> M[Run Nikto Scan]
    K -- SQLmap --> N[Run SQLmap Scan]
    K -- Custom Checks --> O[Run Custom Web Checks]

    L --> P[Collect Raw Output]
    M --> P
    N --> P
    O --> P

    P --> Q[Parse and Normalise Results]
    Q --> R[Store Findings in MySQL]
    R --> S[Return Scan Completed Result]